    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166070/extras/3d830a9481580178dead6ba3f42d19d6.avif?t=1755458789\" width=617 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been chosen by a self-proclaimed Goddess of Life and Abundance and whisked off to another world! Just when you\u2019re ready to step up as the hero, she casually drops a bombshell: this world is going to be destroyed by the Demon Queen in 100 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make matters worse, summoning you drained all of her magic. So:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has no idea who the Demon Queen is, where they are, or how powerful they might be;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re stuck with only passive skills;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She loves using \u201cI\u2019m out of magic!\u201d as an excuse to slack off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your quest to save the world is off to a pretty doomed\u2014and often weird\u2014start. But you\u2019re not alone: this \u201cuseless\u201d goddess is tagging along! Strangely enough, she sometimes smells\u2026 like a fish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only 100 days remaining, explore a world on the brink of destruction, meet unique companions, and set off on a completely unpredictable adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166070/extras/c71bd0399762b110d223c2a225a90889.avif?t=1755458789\" width=617 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 